{"video":"Dq4RqWNRoN4","lines":[{"t":[0,1.1],"en":"I don't know what to do."},{"t":[1.6,2.4],"en":"Do you want my advice?"},{"t":[2.7,3.6],"en":"Yes, please."},{"t":[4.1,5],"en":"You're not gonna like it."},{"t":[5.1,5.7],"en":"That's okay."},{"t":[7.2,8.8],"en":"You got married too fast."},{"t":[11.3,12.5],"en":"That's not advice."},{"t":[12.6,13.1],"en":"I told you."},{"t":[16.9,17.8],"en":"Go to the bathroom."},{"t":[20.7,25.2],"en":"Man, if anyone asks me to give up any of you, I don't think I could do it."},{"t":[26.5,27.6],"en":"Maybe I could do it."},{"t":[30,33],"en":"Okay, Ross is in the bathroom."},{"t":[33.4,34.7],"en":"Oh, my God, it's happening."},{"t":[34.7,35.6],"en":"It's already started."},{"t":[35.7,37],"en":"I'm Kip."},{"t":[37.2,38],"en":"Oh, buddy."},{"t":[38.3,39.5],"en":"Yeah, you're not Kip."},{"t":[39.9,41.3],"en":"Do you even know who Kip is?"},{"t":[42.9,43.8],"en":"Who cares?"},{"t":[43.9,44.5],"en":"You're Rachel."},{"t":[47.8,48.5],"en":"Who's Kip?"},{"t":[49.7,50.9],"en":"Kip, my old roommate."},{"t":[51,52.2],"en":"You know, we all should hang out together."},{"t":[52.6,53.8],"en":"Oh, that poor bastard."},{"t":[55.7,56.1],"en":"See?"},{"t":[56.3,58.7],"en":"Yeah, you told me the story he and Monica dated"},{"t":[58.7,61.4],"en":"when they broke up that couldn't even be in the same room together"},{"t":[61.4,63.5],"en":"and you all promised that you would stay his friend."},{"t":[63.6,64.4],"en":"And what happened?"},{"t":[64.5,65.9],"en":"He got phased out."},{"t":[66.2,67.6],"en":"You're not gonna be phased out."},{"t":[67.9,69.1],"en":"Well, of course I am."},{"t":[69.3,70.3],"en":"It's not gonna happen to Ross."},{"t":[70.3,71],"en":"He's your brother."},{"t":[71.4,72.7],"en":"He's your old college roommate."},{"t":[73.2,74.8],"en":"Oh, you know, it was just a matter of time"},{"t":[74.8,76.3],"en":"before someone had to leave the group."},{"t":[76.3,78.2],"en":"I just always assumed Phoebe would be the one to go,"},{"t":[78.5,78.8],"en":"Ah!"},{"t":[80.8,81.9],"en":"Honey, come on."},{"t":[82,83.1],"en":"You live far away."},{"t":[83.2,84],"en":"You're not related."},{"t":[84.1,85.1],"en":"You lived right out."},{"t":[85.1,92],"en":"Phoebe."},{"t":[95.8,98.8],"en":"I'm sorry about the whole lifting out thing."},{"t":[100.8,102.5],"en":"Look, you gotta come with me."},{"t":[103.1,103.6],"en":"Come where?"},{"t":[103.8,104.6],"en":"Wherever I go."},{"t":[104.9,105.7],"en":"Come on, you and me."},{"t":[105.9,106.8],"en":"We'll start a new group."},{"t":[106.9,107.9],"en":"We're the best ones."},{"t":[112.3,114.1],"en":"Okay, but try to get Joey, too."},{"t":[118.2,121.5],"en":"Phoebs, what if I speak to Rachel alone for a sec?"},{"t":[121.6,122.2],"en":"Oh, sure."},{"t":[125.8,126.7],"en":"Bye, Ross."},{"t":[127.4,127.9],"en":"Forever."}]}
